<title>CANADA: Poco mails Gardiner bid.</title>
<headline>Poco mails Gardiner bid.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poco Petroleums Ltd said that it mailed its C$225 million takeover bid circular to Gardiner Oil and Gas Ltd shareholders.</p>
<p>The offer will expire at 1500 EDT on October 9 unless extended and is subject to at least 90 percent of Gardiner common shares being tendered, and regulatory approvals.</p>
<p>The offer is C$5 cash and 0.6 Poco common share. Poco closed at 11.05 on Tuesday on the Toronto Stock Exchange. Poco has entered into agreements with Gardiner shareholders, who own or control about 73 percent of its issued and outstanding shares. They agreed to deposit their shares and will not withdraw them unless a third party offers at least C$13.50 a share in cash, Poco said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
